fine-tuning interaction. My current thought is that it\'s okay to block workspace interaction during crop mode. I\'m focusing on ensuring it\'s on top and handles resize/drag and handles.\n\n\n\n**Finalizing the UI**\n\nI\'m now putting the finishing touches on the user interface, especially regarding the crop overlay interaction and the overall user experience. I\'m making sure all the cropping interaction is as smooth as possible.\n\n\n**Designing the Toolbar**\n\nI\'m now designing the application toolbar. I\'ll make it a fixed element at the top center of the workspace, which greatly simplifies its implementation. This central placement ensures it\'s always accessible, reducing the need for complex positioning near the selected elements. I\'ll implement rotation, crop mode toggle, and delete functionality, using Lucide icons.\n\n\n**Implementing the Toolbar**\n\nI\'m now implementing the properties toolbar, opting for a fixed position at the top of the workspace. I\'m focusing on rotation controls (slider and input), the crop mode toggle, and the delete button. The toolbar will be visually consistent with the rest of the UI.\n\n\n**Finalizing the Toolbar**\n\nI\'ve completed the toolbar implementation, with all controls in place and functional: rotation, crop toggle, and delete. All components integrate seamlessly for a finished application.\n\n\n**Structuring the Execution**\n\nI\'m now structuring the planned execution. I will ensure all planned actions get executed, with component organization and state implementation. I\'ve initiated edits to project metadata. I will then create type and store files.\n\n\n\n**Executing the Final Steps**\n\nI\'m now focused on executing the final steps to complete the application, from file creation to compilation. I\'m prioritizing the order: first implementing a structured execution, then modifying project metadata. I\'m updating `src/utils.ts`, `src/components/Sidebar.tsx`, `src/components/Toolbar.tsx`, `src/components/ElementNode.tsx`, `src/components/CropOverlay.tsx`, and `src/components/Workspace.tsx`. Finally, I\'ll edit `src/App.tsx` and compile the app. I\'m also planning to initialize `cropBox` in `CropOverlay`.\n\n\n"
