 flex-col\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-gray-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2\\\">Layer Controls</h2>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"mb-6\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase mb-2 block\\\">Rotation</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n          <input type=\\\"range\\\" class=\\\"flex-1 h-1 bg-gray-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-blue-600\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-gray-200\\\">-3.5\302\260</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between mt-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-gray-200 rounded text-[9px] hover:bg-gray-50\\\">90\302\260 CCW</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-gray-200 rounded text-[9px] hover:bg-gray-50\\\">90\302\260 CW</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mb-6\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase mb-2 block\\\">Crop Options</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] hover:bg-gray-50 font-medium\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-3 h-3\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18\\\"/></svg>\\n            Apply Crop\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-2 border border-blue-600 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded text-[10px] font-bold shadow-sm\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-3 h-3\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 4v16m8-8H4\\\"/></svg>\\n            Extract to New\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[9px] text-gray-400 mt-2\\\">Extract creates a new A3 page with only the cropped area at 100% scale.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-gray-50 rounded p-3 border border-gray-200\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase mb-2 block\\\">Metadata</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-400\\\">Resolution</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono\\\">300 DPI</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-400\\\">Native Size</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono\\\">4500 x 3500px</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-400\\\">Scale Locking</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-green-600\\\">ACTIVE</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-4 flex gap-2\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"flex-1 py-2 text-[10px] font-bold border border-red-200 text-red-600 rounded hover:bg-red-50 uppercase\\\">Delete Layer</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Geometric Balance\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Geometric Balance\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-screen w-full bg-[#f3f4f6] font-sans overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <header class=\\\"h-12 bg-white border-b border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-between px-4 z-20 shrink-0\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-6 h-6 bg-blue-600 rounded flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase\\\">M</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <h1 class=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800\\\">IGCSE OS Map Maker</h1>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav class=\\\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-gray-500\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"hover:text-gray-900 cursor-pointer\\\">File</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"hover:text-gray-900 cursor-pointer\\\">Edit</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"hover:text-gray-900 cursor-pointer text-blue-600 font-medium\\\">Workspace</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"hover:text-gray-900 cursor-pointer\\\">Export</span>\\n      </nav>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 text-xs bg-blue-600 text-white rounded hover:bg-blue-700 font-medium transition-colors\\\">\\n        Export as PDF\\n      </button>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"flex flex-1 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-44 bg-white border-r border-gray-200 flex flex-col shrink-0\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"p-3 border-b border-gray-100\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"w-full py-2 bg-gray-50 border-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n          + New Page\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-3 space-y-4\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"relative group cursor-pointer\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"aspect-[1.414/1] bg-white border-2 border-blue-500 shadow-sm rounded overflow-hidden p-1\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-full h-full bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-[8px] text-gray-400\\\">Map Grid 24A</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] mt-1 block text-center font-medium text-blue-600\\\">Slide 1</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"relative group cursor-pointer\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"aspect-[1.414/1] bg-white border border-gray-200 shadow-sm rounded overflow-hidden p-1 opacity-70\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-full h-full bg-gray-50\\\"></div>\\n          </div>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[10px] mt-1 block text-center text-gray-400\\\">Slide 2</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"h-32 mt-8 border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-4\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 mb-2 text-gray-300\\\">\\n            <svg fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-8l-4-4m0 0L8 8m4-4v12\\\"/></svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[9px] text-gray-400 uppercase font-bold\\\">Upload Maps (PDF/PNG)</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"flex-1 relative bg-[#e5e7eb] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute top-4 left-4 flex gap-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm text-[10px] font-mono\\\">\\n          X: 142px Y: 388px\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded shadow-sm text-[10px] font-mono\\\">\\n          Zoom: 100%\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"relative shadow-2xl bg-white flex shrink-0\\\" style=\\\"width: 700px; height: 495px;\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-10 pointer-events-none\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-10 grid-rows-10 w-full h-full border border-gray-300\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"border-r border-b border-gray-300\\\"></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"border-r border-b border-gray-300\\\"></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute\\\" style=\\\"top: 50px; left: 80px; width: 450px; height: 350px; transform: rotate(-3.5deg); border: 2px solid #3b82f6; cursor: move;\\\">\\n           <div class=\\\"w-full h-full bg-[#f8fafc] overflow-hidden relative\\\">\\n             <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-cover opacity-80\\\" style=\\\"background-image: radial-gradient(#94a3b8 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 10px 10px;\\\"></div>\\n             <div class=\\\"p-4 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-gray-400\\\">Map_Fragment_1_50k_v02.tiff</div>\\n             \\n             <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0\\\" style=\\\"border: 1px dashed #3b82f6; top: 40px; left: 60px; right: 80px; bottom: 100px;\\\">\\n               <div class=\\\"absolute -top-1.5 -left-1.5 w-3 h-3 bg-blue-500 border-2 border-white rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n               <div class=\\\"absolute -top-1.5 -right-1.5 w-3 h-3 bg-blue-500 border-2 border-white rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n               <div class=\\\"absolute -bottom-1.5 -left-1.5 w-3 h-3 bg-blue-500 border-2 border-white rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n               <div class=\\\"absolute -bottom-1.5 -right-1.5 w-3 h-3 bg-blue-500 border-2 border-white rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n               <div class=\\\"absolute -bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-blue-600 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded text-[9px] whitespace-nowrap shadow-md\\\">\\n                 ACTIVE CROP AREA\\n               </div>\\n             </div>\\n           </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-2 right-4 text-[9px] font-mono text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">\\n          A3 Landscape Landscape View (420 x 297 mm)\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-64 bg-white border-l border-gray-200 shrink-0 p-4 flex flex-col\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-gray-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2\\\">Layer Controls</h2>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"mb-6\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase mb-2 block\\\">Rotation</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n          <input type=\\\"range\\\" class=\\\"flex-1 h-1 bg-gray-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-blue-600\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-gray-200\\\">-3.5\302\260</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between mt-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-gray-200 rounded text-[9px] hover:bg-gray-50\\\">90\302\260 CCW</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"px-2 py-1 border border-gray-200 rounded text-[9px] hover:bg-gray-50\\\">90\302\260 CW</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mb-6\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase mb-2 block\\\">Crop Options</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded text-[10px] hover:bg-gray-50 font-medium\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-3 h-3\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18\\\"/></svg>\\n            Apply Crop\\n          </button>\\n          <button class=\\\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-2 border border-blue-600 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded text-[10px] font-bold shadow-sm\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-3 h-3\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 4v16m8-8H4\\\"/></svg>\\n            Extract to New\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"text-[9px] text-gray-400 mt-2\\\">Extract creates a new A3 page with only the cropped area at 100% scale.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-gray-50 rounded p-3 border border-gray-200\\\">\\n        <label class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase mb-2 block\\\">Metadata</label>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-400\\\">Resolution</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono\\\">300 DPI</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-400\\\">Native Size</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono\\\">4500 x 3500px</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex justify-between\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] text-gray-400\\\">Scale Locking</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-green-600\\\">ACTIVE</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-4 flex gap-2\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"flex-1 py-2 text-[10px] font-bold border border-red-200 text-red-600 rounded hover:bg-red-50 uppercase\\\">Delete Layer</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
