    thinking: "**Considering Grouping Logic**\n\nI\'m now focusing on implementing a grouping feature. I\'ve considered adding a `groupId` property. The toolbar could include Group/Ungroup buttons, particularly if multiple elements are selected, or a single group is selected. If multiple elements are selected, it should form a new group.\n\n\n**Refining Selection Logic**\n\nI\'ve just reworked the state to use `selectedElementIds: string[]` instead of `id: string | null`. I\'ve also added actions for grouping and ungrouping elements, bringing elements to the front or back, and moving them up or down in the z-index. The actions are implemented now.\n\n\n"
