 button, particularly its vibrant blue, with the existing \"Export to PDF\" button, just to modify it. I\'ll focus on matching the rounded shape and text boldness to match the \"Generate DSE\" button in the screenshot.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 15
      nanos: 280246332
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
